# mesh-poc stage output and binary cache — written by `pnpm --filter
# @dagsocial/mesh-poc stage:up`, kept local. `out.prev/` is the previous
# run's `out/`, rotated aside at every start; it carries the stage CA's
# private key and every mesh node's key file, so it must never show as
# untracked.
